flowchart TD
    A[Terminus / Zeebe Worker] --> B[Generic Router]

    B -->|Sync| C[Champion]
    B -.->|Async| D[Shadow]

    C --> B
    D --> B

    B -->|Champion response| A

    B -.->|Structured Prediction Event| E[Prediction Event Channel]

    E --> F[Persistence Consumer]
    F --> G[(Evaluation Store)]

    G --> H[DS / MLOps Evaluation]
    G --> I[Grafana / Reports]

    J[Final Fraud Label] --> K[Label Join Process]
    G --> K
    K --> L[Champion vs Challenger Evaluation]